Insertion in an Array
Insertion means adding a new element at a particular position/index in an array

Before:
10  20  30  40

Insert 25 at index 2

After:
10  20  25  30  40

Steps for Insertion
arr = [10, 20, 30, 40]
index = 2
value = 25



Example:
int[] arr = new int[10];

arr[0] = 10;
arr[1] = 20;
arr[2] = 30;
arr[3] = 40;

int size = 4;


